# Gitignored files Claude Code copies into every new worktree it creates.

.data/kilorep.db
.data/kilorep.db-wal

.env
.env.google

# node_modules is deliberately absent. The copy walks regular files only and
# drops every symlink — and node_modules/.bin is nothing but symlinks, so the
# worktree got 500MB of packages and not one executable: no prettier, no vite,
# no vitest, no oxlint. The format hook's "node_modules missing" message was
# that, every time. `.claude/hooks/deps.sh` runs `bun install` instead, which
# hardlinks from bun's global cache: ~1.5s, no duplicated disk, working .bin.
